ootball to dolls and sweaters to dresses. When Laure and her family move to a new neighbourhood, local girl Lisa mistakes Laure for a boy. Indulging in this exciting new identity, Laure becomes Mickaël, and so begins a summer of long sunny afternoons, playground games and first kisses. Yet with the school term fast approaching, and with suspicions arising amongst friends and family, Laure must face up to an uncertain future.","tagline":"There's a new kid in town."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Laure a 10 ans. Laure est un garçon manqué. Arrivée dans un nouveau quartier, elle fait croire à Lisa et sa bande qu’elle est un garçon. Action ou vérité ? Action. L’été devient un grand terrain de jeu et Laure devient Michael, un garçon comme les autres. Laure profite de sa nouvelle identité comme si la fin de l’été n’allait jamais révéler son troublant secret."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xACHMezayZLeKv5kqh1Cio2JHUY.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vP4LyCUQIuuLRGhfr0Xt88BNHE6.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":65229,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xACHMezayZLeKv5kqh1Cio2JHUY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xACHMezayZLeKv5kqh1Cio2JHUY.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xACHMezayZLeKv5kqh1Cio2JHUY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xACHMezayZLeKv5kqh1Cio2JHUY.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/plEV1Q5u5caYASlG3pq3ON7acN7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/plEV1Q5u5caYASlG3pq3ON7acN7.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},"candidates":[{"type"